<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Token cost during inference in the Qwen model on Complete Graph. <span id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ptok.</span> indicates the number of prompt tokens used, whereas <span id="S4.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ctok.</span> refers to the number of completion tokens produced by the agents. Cooler colors indicate lower token cost, and warmer colors indicate higher cost, within each column.</figcaption>
