<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Performance comparison between AgentInit and other MAS initialization methods across different MAS frameworks, evaluated on Qwen2.5. The best result in each framework is <span id="A1.T12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span>, and the second-best is <span id="A1.T12.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
